{"LID": 65, "STAGE": 3, "TITLE": "Inversion in English", "TITLE_AR": "القلب في الإنجليزية (التراكيب المقلوبة)", "TIMER": 80, "XP": 55, "FULL_HTML": "\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.9;color:#1e293b\">\n\n<h1 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:3px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:10px\">🎯 الدرس 20: القلب في الإنجليزية — Inversion</h1>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eff6ff;border-right:5px solid #3b82f6;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:18px 0\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#1d4ed8;margin-bottom:8px\">📌 الهدف من الدرس</h2>\n<p>في نهاية هذا الدرس ستكون قادراً على:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>فهم مفهوم <b>Inversion (القلب)</b> وأهميته في الإنجليزية الأكاديمية.</li>\n<li>إتقان <b>القلب بعد الكلمات السلبية</b> (Never, Rarely, Hardly...).</li>\n<li>استخدام <b>القلب الشرطي</b> (Had I known, Were I to go).</li>\n<li>التمييز بين <b>القلب الأدبي</b> و <b>القلب الإلزامي</b>.</li>\n<li>كتابة جمل قويّة احترافية تُرفع مستوى TOEFL Writing.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🔑 ما هو Inversion؟</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7;border:2px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:14px 0\">\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:600\">القلب = عكس ترتيب الفاعل مع الفعل المساعد، تماماً كما في السؤال.</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fde68a\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الجملة العادية</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الجملة المقلوبة</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">I have <b>never</b> seen such a view.</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Never have I</b> seen such a view.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">If I had known, I would have called.</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Had I known</b>, I would have called.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>💡 لماذا نستخدمه؟</b> لإضفاء قوّة وتأكيد، ولرفع مستوى الكتابة الرسمية والأكاديمية.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#059669;margin-top:24px\">📚 الحالات الثماني للقلب</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">1️⃣ بعد الكلمات السلبية في بداية الجملة</h3>\n<p>عندما نبدأ الجملة بكلمة سلبية أو شبه سلبية، يجب قلب الفاعل مع المساعد:</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#ddd6fe\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">الكلمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">المعنى</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Never</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">أبداً</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Never have I seen this.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Rarely / Seldom</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">نادراً</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Rarely does he smile.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Hardly / Scarcely</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">بالكاد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Hardly had I arrived when...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">No sooner</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">ما إن</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">No sooner had he left than...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Not only</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">ليس فقط</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Not only is he smart, but...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Little</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">قليلاً</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Little did she know that...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Under no circumstances</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">تحت أي ظرف لا</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Under no circumstances should you...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Only + (then/when/if)</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">فقط</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Only then did I realize...</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">2️⃣ بنية القلب بعد الكلمات السلبية</h3>\n<div style=\"background:#dcfce7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #16a34a;margin:10px 0\">\n<p><b>🟢 الصيغة:</b> <b>Negative Word + Auxiliary + Subject + Main Verb</b></p>\n<p>✅ <b>Never have I</b> seen such beauty. (لا تقل: Never I have seen)</p>\n<p>✅ <b>Rarely does she</b> complain. (لا تقل: Rarely she complains)</p>\n<p>✅ <b>Not only was he</b> tired, but also hungry. (لا تقل: Not only he was)</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fee2e2;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border-right:4px solid #dc2626;margin:10px 0\">\n<b>⚠️ تنبيه:</b> إذا الفعل لا يحتوي على مساعد، نضيف <b>do/does/did</b>:<br>\n❌ Rarely <s>she goes</s> out → ✅ Rarely <b>does she go</b> out.\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">3️⃣ القلب الشرطي (Conditional Inversion)</h3>\n<p>نستطيع حذف <b>If</b> في الشروط الرسمية وقلب الترتيب:</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fde68a\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الشرط مع If</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الشرط المقلوب (بدون If)</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">If I were rich,...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Were I</b> rich,...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">If he had studied,...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Had he</b> studied,...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">If you should need help,...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Should you</b> need help,...</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">4️⃣ القلب بعد So / Such</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>So</b> beautiful <b>was the view</b> that we stopped to take photos. (كانت المنظر جميلاً جداً لدرجة...)</li>\n<li><b>Such</b> was his anger <b>that</b> he left immediately. (كان غضبه كبيراً لدرجة أنه غادر)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">5️⃣ القلب بعد ظرف المكان (للأسلوب الأدبي)</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>On the table lay</b> an old book. (بدلاً من: An old book lay on the table)</li>\n<li><b>Here comes</b> the bus! (هنا تأتي الحافلة)</li>\n<li><b>There goes</b> my chance. (ها هي فرصتي تذهب)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">6️⃣ Hardly...when / No sooner...than (سلسلة أحداث متتابعة)</h3>\n<div style=\"background:#dbeafe;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #3b82f6;margin:10px 0\">\n<p><b>🟢 الصيغة:</b> Hardly/Scarcely + had + subject + V3 + <b>when</b> + past simple</p>\n<p>📖 <b>Hardly had I</b> sat down <b>when</b> the phone rang. (ما إن جلست حتى رنّ الهاتف)</p>\n<p><b>🟢 الصيغة:</b> No sooner + had + subject + V3 + <b>than</b> + past simple</p>\n<p>📖 <b>No sooner had he</b> arrived <b>than</b> it started to rain. (ما إن وصل حتى بدأ المطر)</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fee2e2;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0\">\n<b>⚠️ تنبيه:</b> Hardly مع <b>when</b> فقط، و No sooner مع <b>than</b> فقط — لا تخلط بينهما!\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">7️⃣ Only + (then/after/when/if) + قلب</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>Only then did I</b> realize the truth.</li>\n<li><b>Only after</b> the meeting <b>did he</b> apologize.</li>\n<li><b>Only when</b> she called <b>did I</b> feel relieved.</li>\n<li><b>Only if</b> you study hard <b>will you</b> pass.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">8️⃣ Not until + قلب</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>Not until midnight did</b> he finish his work. (لم ينهِ عمله إلا منتصف الليل)</li>\n<li><b>Not until I saw</b> her smile <b>did I</b> feel happy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🎯 Mini-Drill — اقلب الجمل الآتية</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e8ff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0\">\n<ol style=\"padding-right:24px\">\n<li>I have never tasted such delicious food. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Never have I tasted such delicious food.</b></span></li>\n<li>She rarely goes to the cinema. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Rarely does she go to the cinema.</b></span></li>\n<li>If I had known about it, I would have come. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Had I known about it, I would have come.</b></span></li>\n<li>I realized the truth only then. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Only then did I realize the truth.</b></span></li>\n<li>He had hardly arrived when the meeting started. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Hardly had he arrived when the meeting started.</b></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">⚠️ الأخطاء العشرة الشائعة</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fecaca\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">❌ خطأ شائع</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">✅ الصواب</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">السبب</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Never <s>I have</s> seen.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Never <b>have I</b> seen.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">القلب إلزامي بعد never</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Rarely <s>she goes</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Rarely <b>does she go</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">نحتاج does مع مضارع بسيط</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Hardly <s>he</s> arrived <s>that</s>...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Hardly <b>had he</b> arrived <b>when</b>...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Hardly مع had + when</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">No sooner he had left <s>when</s>...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">No sooner <b>had he</b> left <b>than</b>...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">No sooner مع than (وليس when)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Only then <s>I realized</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Only then <b>did I realize</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Only + ظرف يستوجب القلب</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><s>If</s> Had I known...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><b>Had I</b> known... (بدون If)</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">قلب الشرط يحذف If</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Not only <s>he is</s> smart.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Not only <b>is he</b> smart.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">القلب بعد not only في البداية</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Little <s>she knew</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Little <b>did she know</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Little سلبية وتستوجب القلب</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Under no circumstances <s>you should</s>...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Under no circumstances <b>should you</b>...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">العبارة سلبية تماماً</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Not until 10 PM <s>he came</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Not until 10 PM <b>did he come</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Not until تستوجب القلب</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🧠 حِيَل الذاكرة</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#dcfce7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #16a34a;margin:10px 0\">\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"السلبي يقلب\":</b> أي كلمة سلبية أو شبه سلبية تبدأ الجملة → اقلب فوراً.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"had-when, sooner-than\":</b> Hardly مع when، No sooner مع than. لا تخلط!</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"احذف If\":</b> If I had → Had I / If I were → Were I / If you should → Should you.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"Only يَستلزم القلب\":</b> Only + (then/when/after/if) دائماً يستلزم قلب الفاعل والمساعد.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"do/does/did المنقذ\":</b> إذا لا يوجد مساعد، أضف do/does/did.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">📊 Quick Recap — الملخص النهائي</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1e40af;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">الحالة</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">الصيغة</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">مثال قصير</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">سلبية في البداية</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Neg + aux + S + V</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Never have I tried.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">شرط مقلوب (نوع 2)</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Were + S + ...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Were I rich,...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">شرط مقلوب (نوع 3)</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Had + S + V3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Had he come,...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Hardly...when</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Hardly had S V3 when...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Hardly had I sat when...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">No sooner...than</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">No sooner had S V3 than...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">No sooner had he left than...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Only + ظرف</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Only then/when did S V</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Only then did I see.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Not until</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Not until... did S V</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Not until 9 did he eat.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">So/Such...that</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">So adj was S that...</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">So tired was I that I slept.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:2px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:6px\">📖 أمثلة تطبيقية (15)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#4f46e5;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">#</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">English</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">العربية</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">القاعدة</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Never have I seen such a magnificent sunset in my entire life.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لم أرَ أبداً غروباً بهذه الروعة في حياتي كلها.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قلب بعد Never في البداية</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">2</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Rarely does the manager attend the morning meetings.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">نادراً ما يحضر المدير اجتماعات الصباح.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قلب بعد Rarely + does</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Hardly had we finished dinner when the guests arrived.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ما إن أنهينا العشاء حتى وصل الضيوف.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Hardly + had + S + V3 + when</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">4</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">No sooner had the bell rung than the students rushed out.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ما إن قُرع الجرس حتى اندفع الطلاب للخارج.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">No sooner + had + V3 + than</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">5</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Had I known about the traffic, I would have left earlier.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لو علمت بالازدحام لكنت غادرت أبكر.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قلب شرط نوع 3 بحذف If</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">6</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Were I in your position, I would accept the offer immediately.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لو كنت مكانك لقبلت العرض فوراً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قلب شرط نوع 2 بحذف If</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">7</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Only after the storm passed did we realize the extent of the damage.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">فقط بعد مرور العاصفة أدركنا حجم الضرر.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Only after + قلب</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">8</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Not only is she an excellent doctor, but she is also a talented painter.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ليست طبيبة ممتازة فحسب، بل رسّامة موهوبة أيضاً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Not only + قلب + but also</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">9</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Little did he know that his life was about to change forever.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لم يكن يعلم أن حياته على وشك أن تتغيّر للأبد.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Little (سلبية) + قلب</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">10</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Under no circumstances should you share your password with anyone.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">تحت أي ظرف من الظروف، لا تشارك كلمة السر مع أحد.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Under no circumstances + should + S</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">11</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">So great was the impact of the speech that the audience stood and clapped.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">كان تأثير الخطاب عظيماً لدرجة أن الجمهور وقف وصفّق.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">So + adj + was + S + that</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Not until midnight did the team finish the project.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لم ينهِ الفريق المشروع إلا في منتصف الليل.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Not until + قلب + did</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Seldom do we get a chance to meet such an inspiring person.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">نادراً ما تتاح لنا فرصة لقاء شخص ملهم كهذا.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Seldom (نادراً) + قلب</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Should you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">إن كان لديك أيّ سؤال، فلا تتردّد في التواصل معنا.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قلب شرط رسمي: Should + S</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">15</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">On the hill stood an ancient castle covered in ivy.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">على التلّة تقف قلعة قديمة يكسوها اللبلاب.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قلب أدبي بعد ظرف مكان</td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#059669;border-bottom:2px solid #059669;padding-bottom:6px\">📚 المفردات الأساسية (18)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#059669;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الكلمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">النطق IPA</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الترجمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">مثال</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">inversion</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪnˈvɜːrʒən/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">قلب / عكس الترتيب</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Inversion is common in formal writing.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">rarely</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈreərli/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">نادراً</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Rarely does he speak in public.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">seldom</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈseldəm/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">نادراً</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">She seldom complains about her work.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">hardly</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈhɑːrdli/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">بالكاد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Hardly had I sat down when he called.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">scarcely</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈskersli/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">بالكاد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Scarcely had we left when it rained.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">no sooner</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/noʊ ˈsuːnər/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ما إن</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">No sooner had he arrived than...</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">under no circumstances</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈʌndər noʊ ˈsɜːrkəmstænsɪz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">تحت أيّ ظرف لا</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Under no circumstances should you lie.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">by no means</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/baɪ noʊ miːnz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">بأي حال من الأحوال لا</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">It is by no means certain.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">on no account</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɒn noʊ əˈkaʊnt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">تحت أيّ ظرف</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">On no account should you open the door.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">magnificent</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/mæɡˈnɪfɪsənt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">رائع / فخم</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">It was a magnificent view.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">realize</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈriːəlaɪz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يدرك</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I didn't realize how late it was.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">impact</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈɪmpækt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">تأثير</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">The impact was enormous.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">extent</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪkˈstent/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">مدى / حجم</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">The extent of damage is unclear.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">hesitate</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈhezɪteɪt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتردّد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Don't hesitate to ask questions.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">inspiring</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪnˈspaɪərɪŋ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">مُلهم</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Her story is truly inspiring.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">ancient</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈeɪnʃənt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">قديم / عريق</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Ancient ruins tell rich stories.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">emphasize</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈemfəsaɪz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يؤكّد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Inversion emphasizes the negative word.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">formal</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈfɔːrməl/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">رسمي</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Inversion is used in formal writing.</td></tr></table></div>"}